апилляров</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://5D055C81-502E-4B5C-A675-AE234015E87F/x-apple-ql-magic/A646AE54-306A-4C19-9E16-A4C811868076.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:207; left:209; width:209; height:119;"><div style="position:absolute; top:231; left:233; width:161; height:71;"><div class="s104"><div class="s9"><p class="s102"><span class="s100">Снижение градиента давлений </span><span class="s100">(</span><span class="s105">Δ</span><span class="s105">P)</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:231; left:528; width:162; height:71;"><div class="s135"><div class="s9"><p class="s6"><span class="s100">Увеличение сопротивления</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://09DDA08B-9A42-4E23-B284-089FE7099009/x-apple-ql-magic/6B573FC4-7A05-4A89-9B47-99099F8B2120.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:138; left:494; width:68; height:51;"><div style="position:absolute; top:322; left:377; width:191; height:68;"><div class="s108"><div class="s9"><p class="s102"><span class="s100">Снижение кровотока в ткани </span><span class="s100">(Q)</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://5D85261F-C13F-4132-8AE0-ED49D5D5EBC8/x-apple-ql-magic/6D5FC385-A8B8-452E-B901-DE83DC77E7DF.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:140; left:317; width:68; height:51;"><div style="position:absolute; top:360; left:155; width:191; height:68;"><div class="s108"><div class="s9"><p class="s6"><span class="s100">Снижение кровоснабжения и метаболизма</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://BB10125E-6097-4217-B6EC-506FEFC83F15/x-apple-ql-magic/0B099F41-F210-4947-AE1E-65DC56C8EEDA.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:140; left:144; width:68; height:51;"><div style="position:absolute; top:461; left:33; width:313; height:68;"><div class="s136"><div class="s9"><p class="s6"><span class="s100">Гипофункция, гипотрофия, некроз</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://476C2C9D-B846-49D0-A270-83DE2C40ACBD/x-apple-ql-magic/399CBE51-2B7F-4360-83EA-9D99CD342DF1.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:369; left:504; width:221; height:119;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://166ED17B-8B2F-4BF0-80A5-E900017065F5/x-apple-ql-magic/B3288B37-2A9F-4113-A96D-11C39641D15D.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:424; left:-5; width:255; height:116;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://5A205CE2-0CC8-4B83-A228-61062ADAF77C/x-apple-ql-magic/82377108-BF10-4EC3-A1D4-08958A33708B.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:331; left:124; width:239; height:116;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://2B011B10-6E39-48AC-9C1D-AD2F02D8EF4A/x-apple-ql-magic/6C497338-E37D-42F1-B158-5613E1FB9498.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:298; left:353; width:221; height:104;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://82DD6BE7-E2C0-4EEE-9414-D864C682ED2D/x-apple-ql-magic/AFFBB5DC-FAFE-4295-BD6C-B6EAADBE36AC.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:207; left:500; width:231; height:119;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://E0629AB3-2ABE-413E-9407-7A47AC5F87F2/x-apple-ql-magic/65768202-ABC5-48A4-803E-009F200E7C69.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:207; left:209; width:209; height:119;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://52FD4B0D-C011-45D1-9D35-8316364A54C1/x-apple-ql-magic/89126768-12DA-4143-B21D-859AB91B84C0.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:114; left:522; width:208; height:108;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://DBE117D9-31F8-49A7-A08D-DE4E501B11DD/x-apple-ql-magic/24E6C6BF-C333-4BDB-9E06-888AE52AFE96.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:114; left:340; width:192; height:108;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://C3A62A70-AC5A-4837-BE75-088A6D3AEF8C/x-apple-ql-magic/95ED4D3B-118D-42DF-8185-6480F8C87261.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:113; left:169; width:193; height:116;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://35F641E3-7758-4872-920E-C6F75D189FB9/x-apple-ql-magic/9DDF8440-103D-44BD-9355-881FB9DFA111.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:113; left:-5; width:193; height:116;"></div><style type="text/css">
